{"id":"04751f66804591ae","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-substitution-representable.md","title":"Substitution Function Representable","display":"thm-substitution-representable — Substitution Function Representable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-substitution-representable","aliases":["92-thm-substitution-representable"],"display":"thm-substitution-representable — Substitution Function Representable","depends_on":["[[92-df-substitution-function]]","[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-tuple-graph-code]]","[[92-thm-representability]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）","source_status":"原书思想的本地重编码"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-substitution-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-substitution-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-substitution-representable — Substitution Function Representable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d8c59019598b33c\" href=\"?note=5d8c59019598b33c\" title=\"92-fact-sub-recursive\">92-fact-sub-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书思想的本地重编码"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span> (substitution function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total recursive extension, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5d8c59019598b33c\" href=\"?note=5d8c59019598b33c\" title=\"92-fact-sub-recursive\">92-fact-sub-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (encoded graph of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_2\">\\(\\Gamma_2\\)</span> (binary-function graph-code constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (representability predicate in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_2(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}),\n\\qquad Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(S_{\\mathrm{Sub}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_2(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}),\n\\qquad Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(S_{\\mathrm{Sub}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span> : 代入函数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span>作用于一元数集，所以先全化代入函数，再使用全书统一的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_2\">\\(\\Gamma_2\\)</span>编码其二元输入与输出图</li>\n<li>该编码图递归，因而在含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的系统中可表示</li>\n<li>这是证明对角化函数可表示的基础</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}(n, n) = d(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}(n, n) = d(n)\\)</span>（对角化函数）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>递归图码集合数码可定义只是集合型结论。内部自引用还需要输出的强唯一性；原书通过将弱函数定义修整成强定义来提供该性质。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"067a36526639087d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","he